      "narrationText": "Raw Honey!\n-\nRanked!\n-\nSimple one.\n-\n82.4 grams of carbs. And that is basically the whole nutrition story.\n-\n0.3 grams of protein. No defensible protein submacros to call out. No real protein story here.\n-\nNo real vitamin story here.\n-\nNo real mineral story here.\n-\nPositives first: strong traditional identity. Tests whether raw honey scores above processed honey via context. Less processed than commercial honey. Should separate it meaningfully in misc. Very familiar use case. Practical relevance.\n-\nThe drawbacks next: still mostly concentrated sugar. This remains the main downside. Overall payoff is still limited. Better than processed honey, not magically elite. Easy to overuse. Practical downside.\n-\nBig strengths are strong traditional identity and less processed than commercial honey, but the biggest weaknesses are still mostly concentrated sugar and overall payoff is still limited.\n-\nB tier.\n"
