              "kind": "section",
              "sectionKey": "cons",
              "text": "Cons next: carb load is still the main burden. That is the category risk no grain fully escapes. Quality can drop fast with processing. The grain category punishes refinement pretty hard. Needs strong pairings to feel complete. The grain rarely finishes the nutrition job alone."
